1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,632
Your IDOR report just got closed: "cannot reproduce."

2
00:00:05,290 --> 00:00:09,836
The triager can't use your accounts, and a screenshot isn't proof.

3
00:00:10,494 --> 00:00:16,384
ReproCase turns your finding into a case anyone can rerun with fresh accounts.

4
00:00:17,044 --> 00:00:23,774
Connect two test accounts. ReproCase checks who each one really is before anything runs.

5
00:00:24,437 --> 00:00:30,591
Run it. Account B reads account A's brand-new object, so the verdict is "Reproduced".

6
00:00:33,659 --> 00:00:40,701
For writes, a 200 isn't enough: the owner reads the object before and after, so the change is proven.

7
00:00:46,119 --> 00:00:52,177
Export one package. The triager reruns it with their own accounts and gets the same verdict.

8
00:00:52,845 --> 00:01:00,055
ReproCase. Free and open source, for Windows, macOS, Linux and Docker. Link below.
